By installing or running StarX you agree to these terms. If you do not agree,
do not install or run it, and uninstall it using Settings > Apps.

1. What StarX is
StarX is a free Windows utility for gamers. It can adjust screen color
(saturation, brightness, gamma, contrast, temperature and similar), change
NVIDIA digital vibrance, switch screen resolution, draw a crosshair overlay,
cap system volume, take color-filtered screenshots, edit a game's launch
options and Rust's client.cfg, and apply optional Windows performance tweaks
(Game Mode, power plan, multimedia scheduler values, mouse acceleration,
fullscreen optimizations, Game DVR).

